title: SilkParasite APT Google Drive C2 Channel
id: ec1006fe-acb1-4c4b-b71b-7f29d118817b
status: experimental
description: >
    Detects anomalous Google Drive API traffic that may indicate SilkParasite
    APT C2 communication. SilkParasite (medium-confidence China-nexus, Aug 2026)
    tunnels RAT traffic through Google Drive, blending C2 into trusted cloud
    activity. Monitor for unusual Google Drive upload/download patterns from
    government or economic-policy organizations in Central Asia.
references:
    - https://cyberpress.org/china-nexus-silkparasite-apt-deploys-five-new-rats/
    - https://gbhackers.com/silkparasite-uses-google-drive-as-c2/
author: Tia N. List
date: 2026/08/21
tags:
    - attack.t1102
logsource:
    category: network_connection
    product: windows
detection:
    selection_drive:
        DestinationHostname|endswith:
            - 'drive.google.com'
            - 'www.googleapis.com'
    selection_api:
        DestinationHostname|contains: 'googleapis.com'
        DestinationPort:
            - 443
    condition: selection_drive and selection_api
falsepositives:
    - Legitimate Google Drive同步 and API usage
    - Google Workspace applications performing routine file operations
level: medium
